Consider the function func shown below:
int func(int num) { 
 int count = 0; 
 while (num) { 
 count++; 
 num>>= 1; 
 } 
 return (count); 
} 
 The value returned by func($435$) is ________

Consider the procedure below for the
 Producer-Consumer
 problem which uses semaphores:
semaphore n = 0; 
semaphore s = 1; 
void producer() 
{ 
 while(true) 
 { 
 produce(); 
 semWait(s); 
 addToBuffer(); 
 semSignal(s); 
 semSignal(n); 
 } 
} 
void consumer() 
{ 
 while(true) 
 { 
 semWait(s); 
 semWait(n); 
 removeFromBuffer(); 
 semSignal(s); 
 consume(); 
 } 
} 
 Which one of the following is
 TRUE
 ?

Consider the following function.
double f(double x){
 if( abs(x*x - 3) < 0.01) 
 return x;
 else 
 return f(x/2 + 1.5/x);
} 
 Give a value $q$ (to $2$ decimals) such that $f(q)$ will return $q$:_____.

